@base = http://localhost:5000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### List agents
GET {{base}}/agents

### Start an agent run (async; returns a runId)
POST {{base}}/runs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "agent", "agent": "editor", "input": "Summarize the README and propose an edit" }

### Start a graph run
POST {{base}}/runs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "graph", "input": "Plan and write a short note" }

### Poll run status (replace {id}) — Status is Running | AwaitingApproval | Completed | Failed
GET {{base}}/runs/{id}

### Approve a pending tool call (replace {id} and {approvalId} from the run's pendingApprovals)
POST {{base}}/runs/{id}/approvals
Content-Type: application/json

{ "approvals": [ { "id": "{approvalId}", "approved": true } ] }

### Ingest RAG sources declared in the loaded config
POST {{base}}/ingest

# Run the server with:  AGORA_CONFIG=examples/agora-hitl.yaml dotnet run --project src/Agora.Api
